Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.82,0:00:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For such a tough guy, he\Nsure was easy to finish off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.62,0:00:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I guess if you think about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.14,0:00:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the end is usually a pretty\Nsudden curtain call, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.02,0:00:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most folks don't get to say goodbye,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.12,0:00:26.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,especially when a bullet\Nto the brain's involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.96,0:00:27.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.88,0:00:31.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think of that as a little parting\Nwisdom before I make you croak.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.04,0:00:34.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.96,0:00:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let him get to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.02,0:00:37.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're much stronger than that!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.04,0:00:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still don't get it, do you? Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.80,0:00:41.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol told you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.78,0:00:43.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He begged you not to fight alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.88,0:00:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you completely ignored him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.40,0:00:51.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if it meant dying with your enemy,\Nyou were hell-bent on getting revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.42,0:00:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He followed you because that worried him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.36,0:00:55.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this is what happened as a result!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.94,0:00:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then tell me, what am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.28,0:01:00.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to fall back for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.38,0:01:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol was stabbed in the back\Nand didn't have a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.38,0:01:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My sister couldn't defend\Nherself and was killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.18,0:01:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You expect me to run away and\Njust forget all this happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.68,0:01:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can we fight them when we don't\Neven know what their stands can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.14,0:01:17.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't fight a battle that'll\Nonly end in your death!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.62,0:01:18.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.54,0:01:20.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol was trying to tell you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.82,0:01:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.36,0:01:23.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it, little pole pole.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.80,0:01:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, you... Polnareff!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.48,0:01:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down and slowly retreat toward me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.68,0:01:30.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.60,0:01:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That truck's our way out of here. Calm?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.86,0:01:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down, you say? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.42,0:01:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:48.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.26,0:01:50.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff!
