Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.46,0:02:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your fault Avdol died, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.74,0:02:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that means you owe him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.40,0:02:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It only seems fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.90,0:02:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your friend bit the dust because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.90,0:02:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you, you bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.10,0:02:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's your real body?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.00,0:02:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.52,0:02:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's no need to be sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.92,0:02:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, you should be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.40,0:02:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're about to see\Nyour dear friend again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.92,0:02:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll soon be dead, and then you can\Nenjoy the afterlife with those two fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.00,0:02:38.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.84,0:02:44.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to say, your\Nsister was so very sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.80,0:02:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once you're reunited with your sister, Be\Nsure to ask her exactly how I killed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.52,0:02:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We had such a ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.88,0:02:59.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Klonorath, don't fall for his tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.06,0:03:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wants you to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.06,0:03:02.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.96,0:03:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, didn't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.56,0:03:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your chariot cannot cut my hanged man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.32,0:03:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in the mirror where your\Nstand can't go that's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.48,0:03:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So close and yet so far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.16,0:03:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whole horse, fire away, let's put\Nan end to this idiot. Aye aye, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.38,0:03:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.00,0:03:45.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hammer roll! Flash!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.26,0:03:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.64,0:03:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, he's shot! Hold around!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.92,0:04:06.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cuckooing, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.06,0:04:08.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not bad, partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.24,0:04:13.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's out of my stance range.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.00,0:04:18.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if I got him from here, the bullet\Nwouldn't hit him with very much force.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.80,0:04:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He went after them, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.64,0:04:23.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.62,0:04:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must really have it in for Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.02,0:04:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, Akemi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.40,0:04:36.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just that...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.90,0:04:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought so long as I could avenge my\Nsister, I wouldn't care if I lived or died.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.80,0:04:44.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I understand now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.20,0:04:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know Avdol was fighting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.16,0:04:50.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His sacrifice won't be for naught.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.48,0:04:53.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll fight to keep on living.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.66,0:04:57.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure that you really\Nmean that, Polnareff?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.90,0:04:58.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oui.
