Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.10,0:05:04.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all I'm giving you is proof\Nthat we've made up, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.20,0:05:07.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.12,0:05:08.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Merci, Kakyoin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.18,0:05:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When those bastards come after us again,\NI swear we'll defeat them together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.38,0:05:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol, my old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.34,0:05:33.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.44,0:05:39.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was so sure that I stabbed him with\Nmy sword, but my strike never hit him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.46,0:05:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was like he wasn't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.16,0:05:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even breaking the mirror\Ninto pieces didn't stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.02,0:05:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hanged man just\Nattacked from the shards.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.00,0:05:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How in the hell am I supposed\Nto fight against that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.88,0:05:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He attacks your reflection.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.62,0:06:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But his knife sinks into your real flesh\Nand my stand can't go inside mirrors
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.14,0:06:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to attack him if he's\Nin some kind of mirror world damn it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.90,0:06:10.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff you keep talking about\Ninside the mirror in the mirror
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.76,0:06:14.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,world But there's no such thing\Nas a world in a mirror remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.98,0:06:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is reality not fantasy
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.98,0:06:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about you saw it too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.70,0:06:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you you can only see him in a mirror\Nand when you turn around he's gone Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.34,0:06:29.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But anything that you see in a mirror\Nis just a reflection created by light.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.28,0:06:30.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.84,0:06:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to tell me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.36,0:06:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, I mean this case.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.32,0:06:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm talking about what's going on now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.28,0:06:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Stans can exist in this world,\Nthere could be a mirror world too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.00,0:06:40.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.00,0:06:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.24,0:06:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that fact is what's going to help\Nus solve the mystery of Hanged Man. Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.44,0:06:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stans are able to destroy other Stans,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.68,0:06:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so there still has to be something\Nwe don't know about his...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.54,0:06:54.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.42,0:07:08.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.34,0:07:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The chrome of the steering wheel!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.88,0:07:10.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.80,0:07:12.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bastards caught up to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.48,0:07:13.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.20,0:07:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.90,0:07:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk to me. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.50,0:07:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I slammed my chest, but I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.90,0:07:36.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.52,0:07:42.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chariot!
