Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.32,0:07:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.72,0:07:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just saw him do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.74,0:07:59.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's going from mirror to mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.92,0:08:03.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy moves by jumping around,\None reflection to another.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.74,0:08:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He traveled all this way by\Nreflecting over and over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.44,0:08:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the only explanation\Nfor how he caught up to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.96,0:08:13.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reflecting?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.88,0:08:15.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means he's actually light.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.48,0:08:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you saying that the true\Nnature of his stand is light?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.30,0:08:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.26,0:08:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just saw him in the car's bumper.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.60,0:08:24.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's going to reflect off that\Nsurface and onto something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.84,0:08:26.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay clear of reflective stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.90,0:08:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take anything shiny off your\Nbody and your uniform button.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.22,0:08:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, mister, are you guys okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.66,0:08:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want me to bring you some medicine?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.52,0:08:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.44,0:08:36.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, it's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.35,0:08:37.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.46,0:08:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, you guys totally messed up your car.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.30,0:08:43.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're bleeding, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.60,0:08:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.64,0:08:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.86,0:08:53.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's reflected in the kid's eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.82,0:08:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, kid, don't look at us! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.48,0:09:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you, don't look at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.38,0:09:04.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't follow me with your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.18,0:09:05.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.10,0:09:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But your heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.30,0:09:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.22,0:09:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfectly fine, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.64,0:09:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So go look over there! But...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.96,0:09:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you're bleeding!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.24,0:09:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You brat, I said look over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.92,0:09:14.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.86,0:09:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Xeniphaled!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.22,0:09:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.78,0:09:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't poke out this cute little\Nkid's eye with that sword of yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.32,0:09:25.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.80,0:09:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.98,0:09:28.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.90,0:09:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now I finally got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.06,0:09:32.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't run anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.84,0:09:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not unless you gouge the kid's eyes out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.48,0:09:40.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You disgusting, cruel son\Nof a bitch! You're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.46,0:09:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Kakyoin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.62,0:09:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mon frere, that's not what\Nyou say at a time like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.16,0:09:58.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, in times like these, you've\Ngot to say something fitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.40,0:10:01.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before you get your revenge,\Nsay something like this here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.18,0:10:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Jean-Pierre Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.94,0:10:08.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the honor of my dearest sister's soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.36,0:10:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and so my good friend Avdol can\Nrest peacefully in heaven above?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.78,0:10:14.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to hurl you into\Nthe depths of despair!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.58,0:10:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself, centerfold!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.88,0:10:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about this, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.54,0:10:23.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll buy you whatever\Ncandy you want, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.64,0:10:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got dead in my eyes!
