Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.12,0:10:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't really understand how, but he\Nessentially moves at the speed of light.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.20,0:10:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one can normally see speed like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.98,0:10:48.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then, I knew that if the kid closed\Nhis eyes, the next move would be to my eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.20,0:10:51.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was no other place for him to\Ngo, and that's how we'll beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.50,0:10:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.88,0:10:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hanged man can only exist\Nwithin the world of reflection.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.56,0:11:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When one world is about to be destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.38,0:11:04.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he must migrate to\Nanother reflective object.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.02,0:11:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, as long as I can read his trajectory,\NI can slice through him like butter!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.20,0:11:13.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His real body is over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.42,0:11:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard. Finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.82,0:11:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.68,0:11:33.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At last we meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.52,0:11:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Centerfold!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.74,0:11:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Jean-Pierre Polnareff,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.52,0:11:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I've seen through your\Nstand's clever little trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.46,0:11:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a Stand of light that\Nmoves at incredible speeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.14,0:11:51.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know there's no way that I can catch it,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.50,0:11:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if I can predict where your\Nstand's going to jump next,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.00,0:11:59.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I slash its trajectory in\Nthat moment, I can cut you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.98,0:12:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Kakyoin and Avdol hadn't shown up,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.62,0:12:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I probably wouldn't have figured that\Nout and you would have killed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.20,0:12:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Polnareff!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.54,0:12:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't the man with\Na pair of right hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.90,0:12:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not Cinderella!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.64,0:12:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.86,0:12:21.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff!
