Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.32,0:12:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At last!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.82,0:12:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That man is some beggar who was in\Nthe wrong place at the wrong time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.10,0:12:56.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just carved a small wound in him, the\Nsame wound you were so gracious to give me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.92,0:13:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You totally fell for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.38,0:13:04.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Getting close to him without knowing\Nwhat I look like was a grave mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.56,0:13:07.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One you'll pay for with your limes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.80,0:13:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.30,0:13:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take this! Emerald!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.88,0:13:14.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.80,0:13:15.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.71,0:13:16.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a good look around you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.10,0:13:19.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.02,0:13:20.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gather round!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.64,0:13:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See these two gentlemen?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.44,0:13:26.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They say they've got a\Nboatload of cash to share!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.68,0:13:31.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What will you give us\Nmoney for nothing, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.46,0:13:33.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,such generosity you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.56,0:13:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,such big heart? thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.84,0:13:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have you figured out what's going on yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.40,0:13:47.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you say you figured out my stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.94,0:13:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.14,0:13:51.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you think i don't know my own weakness?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.84,0:13:56.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i have no weakness?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.38,0:13:58.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you can never know\Nwhere i'll jump to next?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.64,0:14:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't look?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.94,0:14:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't stare at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.38,0:14:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,please?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.38,0:14:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just look away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.72,0:14:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you can't run anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.64,0:14:09.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.70,0:14:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,blow everyone up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.28,0:14:15.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you sacrificed your entire youth?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.58,0:14:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just taught me down?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.66,0:14:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and just when you're close?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.32,0:14:19.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.24,0:14:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to fail to avenge your sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.88,0:14:22.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How pathetic and sad. Meanwhile,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.28,0:14:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, Center, will continue a life surrounded\Nby young beauties, like your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.16,0:14:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.50,0:14:30.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, the pleasures.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.66,0:14:35.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, that\Nsweet sister of yours
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.06,0:14:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was really good at sobbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.80,0:14:44.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.74,0:14:46.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.08,0:14:47.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnarex.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.00,0:14:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could do better than that. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.40,0:14:51.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why you isn't what you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.14,0:14:55.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When taking revenge, you\Nhave to be more refined.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.18,0:14:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.86,0:15:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Noriaki Kakyoin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.40,0:15:02.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In order to avenge my dear friend Avdol,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.22,0:15:08.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so that the soul of my friend Polnarev's\Nsister may rest in peace for all eternity?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.42,0:15:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will have you pay with your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.24,0:15:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give this gold coin to\Nwhoever picks it up. Behold!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.88,0:15:20.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A coin so perfect, it\Nshines like a mirror!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.68,0:15:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, now I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.14,0:15:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like all of their eyes are\Nfocused on one point now. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.56,0:15:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know the trajectory that\NHanged Man will have to take.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.00,0:15:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Merci, Capri!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.42,0:15:51.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now!
