Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.32,0:16:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.24,0:16:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't open!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.06,0:16:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're the one who's\Nreally good at sobbing, Centerfold.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.02,0:16:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you're about to plummet into hell,\Nbegging and crying the whole way down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.30,0:16:23.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's one thing I can't rely\Non the Guardians of Hell to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.48,0:16:28.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's to turn your\Nbody into a pincushion.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.74,0:16:35.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting years for this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.88,0:16:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll leave the rest to Yoma. Rot in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.30,0:16:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is the true hanged man, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.16,0:16:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was rotten all the way to the core.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.98,0:17:02.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got my revenge.
