Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.34,0:17:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.58,0:17:19.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally caught up with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.98,0:17:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you walking so slow?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.76,0:17:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're gonna run, run\Nlike your lives depend on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.24,0:17:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's way more fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.98,0:17:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Mr. Cinefold?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.64,0:17:42.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better say your prayers, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.12,0:17:45.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is where your lives come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.30,0:17:48.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come at us with everything\Nyou've got, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.20,0:17:52.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so boring if you just stand\Nthere and die. Right, Mr. Centerfold?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.94,0:18:01.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.14,0:18:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Centerfold, aren't you going to play?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.14,0:18:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think he's listening\Nanymore, cowboy. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.54,0:18:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's quite busy at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.38,0:18:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Carrying out his sentence in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.70,0:18:20.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't try to pull that nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.98,0:18:22.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bluffing won't work on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.70,0:18:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice try, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.94,0:18:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way you could have beaten him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.00,0:18:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even I wouldn't try my\Nluck against that mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.48,0:18:35.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, Polnareff, your\Nsense of humor stinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.46,0:18:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That piece of shit's corpse is 2 or 3,000
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.40,0:18:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,meters that way if you\Nwant to take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.54,0:18:42.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.38,0:18:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I will. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.62,0:18:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.96,0:18:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.76,0:18:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm at a total disadvantage by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.78,0:18:55.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm hightailing it out of here,\Nwaiting for a better chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.66,0:18:59.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or better yet, waiting till I find\Nmyself another partner in crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.48,0:19:02.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all about being number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.68,0:19:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the motto I like to live by.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.88,0:19:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got a problem with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.64,0:19:09.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.90,0:19:13.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.82,0:19:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.72,0:19:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We already know about\NAvdol. What a tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.46,0:19:25.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We didn't have a lot of time to do much\Nfor him, but we gave him a proper funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.50,0:19:30.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one who stabbed Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.12,0:19:33.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol in the back was the\Nman with two right hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.98,0:19:36.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the cause of death\Nwas Hol Horse's bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.60,0:19:39.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should we do with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.42,0:19:41.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give him his sentence!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.34,0:19:49.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DEATH!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.98,0:19:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please run, Sir Hall Horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.16,0:19:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll hold him up for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.72,0:19:56.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.64,0:19:57.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get off, lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.55,0:20:01.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what exactly is going on here,\Nbut I do know I will always protect you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.26,0:20:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are my everything,\Ndarling! Please run! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.88,0:20:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go of me, stupid bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.86,0:20:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.26,0:20:12.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Jotaro! Kakyoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.18,0:20:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let Hol Horse get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.92,0:20:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.32,0:20:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well said, my little sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.98,0:20:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll gladly accept your\Nfeelings and keep on living.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.22,0:20:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, I'm only running\Naway because I love you, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.18,0:20:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forever and ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.32,0:20:33.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.20,0:20:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.96,0:20:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't you dare aww at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.44,0:20:45.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.36,0:20:47.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That woman is just another\None of his victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.54,0:20:51.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he no longer had any\Nintention of fighting with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.92,0:20:53.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have no time to deal with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.70,0:20:58.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol is gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.82,0:21:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we have to forge ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.28,0:21:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's already been fifteen days.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.48,0:21:07.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have time to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.30,0:21:12.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.38,0:21:14.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess it can't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.66,0:21:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, we continue onward to Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.94,0:21:22.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.86,0:21:25.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In order to defeat Dio,\Nwe have to fight as one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.12,0:21:31.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't go off on our own, or we'll play\Nright into the enemy's hands. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.34,0:21:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get a move on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.92,0:21:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.26,0:22:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the old paintings on the tomb.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.70,0:22:15.12,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the old paintings on the tomb
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.02,0:22:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They do the sand dance, don't you know?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:15.12,0:22:17.37,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They do the sand dance, don'tcha know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.08,0:22:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they move too quick.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.37,0:22:18.83,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,If they move too quick
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.30,0:22:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're falling down like a domino.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.62,0:22:22.09,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They're falling down like a domino
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.72,0:22:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the birds are men by the Nile.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:22.09,0:22:24.42,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the bazaar men by the Nile
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.40,0:22:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've got their money on a bed.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.42,0:22:26.76,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They got the money on a bet
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.44,0:22:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Called crocodiles.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.76,0:22:28.26,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Gold crocodiles
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.04,0:22:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They snap their teeth on your cigarette.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.93,0:22:31.43,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They snap their teeth on your cigarette
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.02,0:22:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Falling tight to the hookah. I say.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.43,0:22:33.60,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Foreign types with their hookah pipes say
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.94,0:22:42.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Walk like an Egyptian.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:40.60,0:22:43.15,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Walk like an Egyptian
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.94,0:22:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blonde waitresses.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.53,0:22:57.00,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,The blonde waitresses take their trays
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.62,0:22:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take their trays.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.00,0:22:59.37,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They spin around and they cross the floor
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.02,0:22:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spin around and they cross the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.02,0:23:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've got the moves.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:59.37,0:23:00.62,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They've got the moves
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.54,0:23:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You drop, you drink.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.67,0:23:04.00,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,You drop your drink then they bring you more
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.46,0:23:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then they bring you more.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.68,0:23:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the school kids are sick of books.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:04.00,0:23:06.34,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the school kids so sick of books
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.32,0:23:08.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're like the punk and the metal band.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.34,0:23:08.67,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They like the punk and the metal band
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.38,0:23:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the buzzer rings.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.67,0:23:10.13,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,When the buzzer rings
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.62,0:23:12.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're walking like an Egyptian.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.97,0:23:13.30,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They're walking like an Egyptian
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.62,0:23:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the kids in the marketplace say. Walk
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.30,0:23:15.51,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the kids in the marketplace say
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.72,0:23:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.65,0:23:25.73,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Walk like an Egyptian
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.36,0:23:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an Egyptian.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.98,0:23:28.99,Next Episode,,0,0,0,,{\fs120\pos(960,730)}Next Episode
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.20,0:23:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.52,0:23:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The city of Varanasi. Varanasi!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.82,0:23:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.88,0:23:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Joseph Joestar, an American! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.30,0:23:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.38,0:23:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, doesn't that sort of\Nlook like a person's face?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.98,0:23:40.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show me me!
